 to exit the levelup screen to validate it).","source_tag":"tformat","target":"立刻解除符文紊乱和纹身紊乱。\n\t\t接下来 %d 回合内，你的刻印冷却速度翻倍。\n\t\t技能达到 5 级时，你对刻印的掌控使你可以再使用一个刻印；仍需消耗一个大系点解锁，而且必须退出升级界面后才会生效。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1f37b206824a67614189b3b6b54399778123429da512e9d0daad1120ebf091bd","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a4cd0ddc6da046d57f12c323b42f3f2d8fa2b8ca4ad10e9f942f6301a21e48e3","logical_entry_identity":"07a8e76a0d3a6d3ea8b37bfd0e049add2320de479f5269dd27cc57df670a5596","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":" and %s","source_tag":"tformat","target":"和 %s"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2c26d8d150bb38394424177b07629aa0508d1608f22f469bde7c83ba9b66b8ad","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a4cdb9a7564deef4d34e44bfbc76946a45c2905da519e788a464ef5b7144b1d1","logical_entry_identity":"f81620c77dac2b8375fadb89e59cc76cf51897546f0e2b4eebf59e6889cf27c1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The gloom reduces the target's global speed by %d%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"降低目标全局速度 %d%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"40351b8324e38f05c1fb21ea8c3c54588ffc5fedf1546fa323e521ef47886d35","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a4d09459ddd3f05dc2e9dfb4c38e5dd0201c3e3e5ef85591a4a76ef531547cb4","logical_entry_identity":"65066dc20db25ceb2473eff969a4b7799200ef4c72683406a677fef14b82e50e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Charge through your opponents, attacking anyone near your path for %d%% (at 0 Hate) to %d%% (at 100+ Hate) damage. %s opponents may be knocked away from your path. You can attack a maximum of %d times, and can hit targets along your path more than once.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"冲过你的目标，途经的所有目标受到 %d%% （0仇恨）至 %d%% （100+仇恨）伤害。%s 体型的目标会被你弹开。你最多可以攻击 %d 次，并且你对路径上的敌人可造成不止 1 次攻击。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f64661540e130ca82067fa41d3f39f1d68eca75b3efbab85ace07e8299a128ee","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a4d3d40ca72e8fa2dd24247ea6e5c24a140504214286e075368e1850ffd661fe","logical_entry_identity":"248062abcc5de28e2a7b3ebe74212e319d5b52b8ad1440316589eda8d24d60ab","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The trail leads out to a clearing where a group of people sit around talking.\t\nThis is the merchant caravan you once belonged to. You haven't thought of them for a long time, but now they haunt your dreams.\n\nYou suddenly realize how much you despise them now. Is it this hate that fuels your curse?\nThey wanted to kill you, but left you to die instead. They could feel what you had become.\nAnd they can feel it now. Each in turn grabs a weapon and begins to head your way...\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"小径通向一片空地，一群人正坐在那里交谈。\n这就是你曾经加入的那支商队。你已经很久没有想起他们了，但是现在他们却萦绕在你的梦境中。\n\n你突然意识到，自己如今竟如此憎恨他们。是这份仇恨在滋养你的诅咒吗？\n他们曾经想杀死你，但最终却选择抛弃你，让你自生自灭。他们当时能察觉你变成了什么。\n如今，他们又感觉到了。他们一个接一个拿起武器，开始朝你走来……\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"58b2a60c3aa2fe3b1c086a3057229fba0561894940266efe37c7bb06d2c412ae","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a4d452cbd10afe1265557f152d50965c7b1435db3767eb816184f901f2a4e751","logical_entry_identity":"53ac91ecf4be3af681dbfe66d30e9741f39b63bb36320d8a3cc6d37e07d2933d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Unique","source_tag":"_t","target":"神器"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a8d11590d3f1ea453c195c5c5354c320195c323e93b6b82ff4c2080279488374","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a4d5507873ab2c3e43aaa063e1eef4bb9cecac3523cbaf28d470b11438258d10","logical_entry_identity":"84195d0341d40f5eaef2ba661e5e552b8abb1fe57f2014aef5e4f43f9af57d7f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Grave chill","source_tag":"_t","target":"墓地深寒"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"567549f892f0a0a8192a1f72a46f2087d164f68047b915ed71c80884d299179d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a4d99e653c53398358087d67dc86df1a4ef25a0c218ae31e9e90c46814c5e445","logical_entry_identity":"9de68f0f9ac90c8bf7012f3140f6ebe346aad05cedf56f19a36c100501389934","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"pair of dwarven-steel boots","source_tag":"entity name",